ed_at":"2016-07-04T04:32:58Z"},"body":"There's [a bug fix](https://github.com/netty/netty/issues/5372) in this version. \n\nThanks for this great lib. :wink:\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jchambers/pushy/issues/334/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jchambers/pushy/issues/334/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/comments/232823456","html_url":"https://github.com/netty/netty/issues/5372#issuecomment-232823456","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/5372","id":232823456,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDIzMjgyMzQ1Ng==","user":{"login":"ylgrgyq","id":1115061,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTUwNjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1115061?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylgrgyq","html_url":"https://github.com/ylgrgyq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylgrgyq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylgrgyq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylgrgyq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylgrgyq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylgrgyq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylgrgyq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylgrgyq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylgrgyq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylgrgyq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-07-14T23:41:20Z","updated_at":"2016-07-14T23:44:58Z","body":"Hi, @normanmaurer \n\nCould you please tell me why [OpenSslContext use finalize](https://github.com/netty/netty/blob/4.1/handler/src/main/java/io/netty/handler/ssl/OpenSslContext.java#L384) to release resources used by the Context? Why not just provide an explicit termination method and let the user to call it and do the releasing stuff in this termination method?\n\nBecause, I think you already heard,  a lot of people say that `finalize` is evil. It's performance is bad, when even weather it will be called is not determined. Maybe the object is already unreachable for a long time but `finalize` method on this object is not called which could lead to a lot of unreachable object linger on heap. \n\nI admit that use `finalize` here is more user friendly, but still think an explicit termination method maybe much safer. Like showed in this issue, if let user call the termination method I think the  OpenSslContext will not leak. WDYT?\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/comments/232823456/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ylgrgyq","id":1115061,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTUwNjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1115061?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylgrgyq","html_url":"https://github.com/ylgrgyq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylgrgyq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylgrgyq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylgrgyq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylgrgyq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylgrgyq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylgrgyq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylgrgyq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylgrgyq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ylgrgyq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":723739747,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50